        "text_bwTyqT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Patches</h3><p>All new coolers come with a standard 2x3\" Velcro Patch for easy/cost effective corporate branding.</p><p>This is typically 2.5x cheaper than the embroidery option and is our go-to for Custom Coolers.<br/></p><h3>Embroidery</h3><p>We have 3 main options for location of your logo:</p><ol><li>On the backpack strap webbing.</li><li>On the backpack strap mesh.</li><li>On the handle on the back of the cooler.</li></ol><p>Embroidery is done through a 3rd party service, typically sourced by the customer, though Monti is also able to utilize a local embroidery shop to make this a one-stop-shop process. <br/><br/>What are you waiting for!? Reach out at <strong>sales@monticoolers.com</strong></p>"
