          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you help with design?",
            "text": "<p>We are happy to help with simple patch designs and embroidery aesthetics! More complex from-scratch designs can be sourced easily from a graphic designer. We accept nearly all major file formats (.png, .ai, .pdf, etc...). Patches a 2x3\". </p>",
